# @file .gitignore
# @project SlothAsk
# @module Workspace / Version Control
# @description 管理仓库级忽略规则，过滤构建产物、本地环境文件、编辑器缓存和运行时日志。
# @logic 1. 过滤 Java、Node.js、Python 构建输出；2. 过滤 IDE、系统与 Codex 本地缓存；3. 保留源码、配置模板和内容型文档目录。
# @dependencies Git ignore rules, Maven, Node.js, Python, Codex Desktop
# @index_tags gitignore, 版本管理, 缓存过滤, 临时文件, 构建产物
# @author holic512

# Spring Boot helper docs
HELP.md

# Operating system / desktop files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE and editor metadata
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.apt_generated
.classpath
.factorypath
.project
.settings/
.springBeans
.sts4-cache
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
*~

# Local environment and machine-specific config
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template
*.local

# Codex / local tooling caches
.codex-tmp/

# Java / Maven / Gradle build outputs
target/
build/
.gradle/
.m2repo/
**/.m2repo/

# Frontend dependencies, caches and bundles
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
coverage/
.npm/
.pnpm-store/
.yarn/
.parcel-cache/
.next/
.nuxt/
.turbo/
.cache/
.eslintcache
.sass-cache/
*.tsbuildinfo
stats.html

# Python virtualenvs and caches
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.py[cod]

# Logs and runtime files
logs/
*.log
*.pid
*.pid.lock
*.seed
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Temporary / patch leftovers
*.orig
*.rej
*.bak
*.tmp
*.temp
